  "answer": "For a Growth customer paying annually:\n\n- **Base monthly price**: $3,600/month [NL-003#NL-003-S02], [NL-001#NL-001-S05]\n- **Annual base price**: $3,600 × 12 = $43,200\n- **Annual prepayment discount**: 10% on the base subscription fee for Growth customers [NL-003#NL-003-S07], [NL-001#NL-001-S05]\n- **Discount amount**: 10% × $43,200 = $4,320\n- **Discounted base annual price**: $43,200 − $4,320 = $38,880\n- **One-time onboarding fee (Growth)**: $7,500 [NL-003#NL-003-S02], [NL-003#NL-003-S04], [NL-001#NL-001-S05]\n\nThe onboarding fee is a one-time, non-recurring charge and is not treated as monthly recurring revenue (MRR). Therefore, the combined total is:\n\n$38,880 (discounted annual base) + $7,500 (onboarding) = **$46,380**\n\nDiscounts apply only to the base subscription fee; they do not apply to onboarding fees [NL-003#NL-003-S07]. Note that the deprecated 2025 pricing ($2,800/month for Growth, $4,500 onboarding) is obsolete and superseded by the 2026 schedule [NL-003#NL-003-S08], [NL-004#NL-004-S02].\n\nANSWER_STATUS: answer\nUSED_MEMORY_CLAIMS: none",
